# Phase 5 lifecycle (L-U3b): `--resume` with no usable HOME, which has no
# store to resume from (fx v0.0.16 21a55a45). The workspace holds the folder
# the relative HOME names, so anything kept there would show in `workls`.
work p5-relhome-made
env HOME=relative/homedir
keep
wait 3
type /quit
key Enter
wait 2
fx: relaunch --resume-last
xfx: relaunch --resume last
wait 4
snapfull r00-resume
workls r01
